{
  "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json",
  "name": "feedbax",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/jessequartey/feedbax",
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "feedbax-feedback",
      "type": "registry:block",
      "title": "Feedbax Feedback",
      "description": "A roomy feedback dialog with one-click screenshot capture, an annotation editor (pen, arrow, rectangle, highlight, redact) and single sign-on to your Feedbax portal.",
      "registryDependencies": [
        "button",
        "dialog",
        "dropdown-menu",
        "input",
        "label",
        "textarea",
        "tooltip"
      ],
      "dependencies": ["modern-screenshot@4.7.0", "lucide-react"],
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/components/feedback-dialog.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "@components/feedbax/feedback-dialog.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/components/annotation-editor.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "@components/feedbax/annotation-editor.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/components/attachments.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "@components/feedbax/attachments.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/components/parts.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "@components/feedbax/parts.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/components/feedbax-link.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "@components/feedbax/feedbax-link.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/lib/annotation.ts",
          "type": "registry:lib",
          "target": "@lib/feedbax/annotation.ts"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/lib/capture.ts",
          "type": "registry:lib",
          "target": "@lib/feedbax/capture.ts"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/lib/client.ts",
          "type": "registry:lib",
          "target": "@lib/feedbax/client.ts"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/lib/draft.ts",
          "type": "registry:lib",
          "target": "@lib/feedbax/draft.ts"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/lib/images.ts",
          "type": "registry:lib",
          "target": "@lib/feedbax/images.ts"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/lib/token.server.ts",
          "type": "registry:lib",
          "target": "@lib/feedbax/token.server.ts"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/feedbax-feedback/lib/types.ts",
          "type": "registry:lib",
          "target": "@lib/feedbax/types.ts"
        }
      ],
      "docs": "1) Server: set FEEDBAX_HOST_SECRET (from the portal's .dev.vars) in your server env and add an authenticated POST /api/feedbax-token route that returns { token: await mintFeedbaxToken({ secret, user: { id, name } }) } with Cache-Control: no-store. Take the user from your own session, never from the request body, and import lib/feedbax/token.server.ts from server code only. 2) Render <FeedbaxDialog portalUrl=\"https://your-portal\" /> (and optionally <FeedbaxLink portalUrl=\"https://your-portal\">Go to feedback</FeedbaxLink>). 3) Set appUrl in the portal's feedbax.config.ts to your app's URL and redeploy the portal. Mark anything that must not appear in screenshots with data-feedbax-ignore."
    }
  ]
}
